# ===== Optional: lockfiles (choose your package manager) =====
# If you use npm, keep package-lock.json (so DON'T ignore it)
# If you use pnpm, keep pnpm-lock.yaml (so DON'T ignore it)
# If you use yarn, keep yarn.lock (so DON'T ignore it)
# Uncomment ONE of these only if you intentionally don't want lockfiles tracked:
# package-lock.json
# pnpm-lock.yaml
# yarn.lock
